*> vybe-test: cobol/category_intrinsic_date/test_date_test_invalid_year
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_category_intrinsic_date.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. T. DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
01 WS-VYBE-N PIC 9(9)V9(4) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION. DISPLAY FUNCTION TEST-DATE-YYYYMMDD(15000101).
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    COMPUTE WS-VYBE-N = FUNCTION TEST-DATE-YYYYMMDD(15000101)
    STRING WS-VYBE-N DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "0000000010000"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [0000000010000] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF. STOP RUN.

